    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73e87c40109ddcbd8d5043e4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "白天训练时她应该就很累了……\n一个人出了门，真的没问题吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "94f36970aa71343bfdde0cba07242c1f4c9dce6e34b9db83841180550fda921c",
